Subject: [PATCH] docs: record patches 136 to 142 in the stack manifest

Phase P0 of the IndexedDB redesign: the cherry-picked cursor fix, the
executor layer with its tests on every backend, the schema version, the
executor's handling of errors that end a transaction, and the tests of
the RDB behaviour the executors rely on. Patches that edit upstream
files are tier C, those that only add or change fork files tier A; this
bookkeeping entry is B, like the earlier ones.

Validation: `uv run docs/ohos-sync/check_stack.py base/2026-11-09` passes.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; written by the agent, and regenerated after the review fixes to the P0 commits)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
